OL,3,GNEWSAResidents near Heathrow unhappy
OL,4,Awith compensation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a village under the
OL,7,FHeathrow Airport flight path have hit
OL,8,Fout at potential compensation linked to
OL,9,Fplans for a third runway.
OL,11,FResidents of Stanwell Moor, in Surrey,
OL,12,Fhave described a mooted payment of
OL,13,F#3,000 as "unfair" given the #6,500
OL,14,Foffered to residents close to Gatwick
OL,15,FAirport, which is set to build a second
OL,16,Frunway.
OL,18,FThe government published its blueprint
OL,19,Ffor a third runway at Heathrow in June,
OL,20,Fdescribing expansion of the airport as
OL,21,F"critical to national growth".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
