OL,3,GNEWSAResidents near Heathrow unhappy
OL,4,Awith compensation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Heathrow spokesperson said: "While
OL,7,F[Gatwick] is providing slightly higher
OL,8,Fcompensation in lower noise areas, it
OL,9,Fis for a far narrower pool of people
OL,10,Fimpacted."
